    /// EMPTY test + the portal count pc 145-160 the MutableInt keeps,
    /// the bound-exhaust the 21 pc 173-175 keeps; the `d < 3 || d >
    /// 21` band pc 22-49 the 0 keeps and the TOP FRAME (javap
